{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>If not this I will do.</b> There are three consecutive verses of one matter in this pericah, and they are: אם יראו את הארץ אשר נשבעתי, אם אתם תבואו אל הארץ, אם לא זאת אעשה לכל העדה — like a person who says, 'If I do not do this thing, such and such will happen to me.' Except that He did not wish to spell it out, for the honor of the Shechinah." "<b>Who gathered themselves against me.</b> Who said, 'Let us depose my servant, until my glory is seen.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:00.337653090Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}